  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "<strong>Indulge in Ultimate Luxury at Our Newly Constructed Gulf-Front Oasis in Santa Rosa Beach</strong><br><br>Welcome to your dream 30A getaway—where elegance meets the emerald waters of the Gulf. This stunning, newly constructed beachfront estate is located on the exclusive west end of Scenic Highway 30A in the charming Dune Allen Beach area. Ideally positioned just steps from public beach access and minutes from premier shopping and dining in Sandestin and the Silver Sands Premium Outlets, this luxury retreat offers the perfect blend of privacy, space, and convenience.<br><br>Spanning over 6,500 square feet across three beautifully appointed floors—and sleeping up to 38 guests—this home is thoughtfully designed for large multi-family gatherings, corporate retreats, or friends traveling together. Every bedroom features its own private en-suite full bathroom with a walk-in shower, ensuring ultimate comfort and privacy for all guests. A full home layout is available upon request.<br><br><strong>Top Features:</strong><br><br>Sleeps 38 | 11 Bedrooms | 13.5 Bathrooms<br><br>Every bedroom has a private en-suite full bathroom with a shower<br><br>Brand new 6-seater golf cart included FREE<br><br>Rooftop deck with Gulf views, outdoor TV, sink, and speakers<br><br>Large private pool + oversized spa<br><br>Complimentary daily beach setup: 2 chairs & 1 umbrellas<br><br>Elevator access to all floors<br><br>Ample parking for up to 10 vehicles<br><br><strong>Home Layout:</strong><br><br><ul> <li><strong>1st Floor:</strong> - 2 bedrooms: 1 king suite + 1 Pool-view master suite - Full living area + kitchenette with ice maker - Easy access to pool and backyard area </li> <li><strong>2nd Floor:</strong> - Chef’s kitchen with massive island, premium appliances - Dining for 22 indoors + 12 on Gulf-view deck - 4 bedrooms: 1 Gulf-view master, 2 king suites, and a bunk room with 3 queen-over-queen bunks - Large, open-concept living and dining space for group gatherings </li> <li><strong>3rd Floor:</strong> - 5 bedrooms: 2 Gulf-view master suites, 2 additional king suites, and a large bunk room with 3 queen-over-queen bunks - Full living area + kitchenette - Balcony with panoramic Gulf views </li> <li><strong>4th Floor Rooftop Deck:</strong> - 2,000 sq ft of open-air living - Plush outdoor furniture - Sink, outdoor TV, and surround speakers - Ideal for sunset cocktails or stargazing </li> </ul><br><strong>Outdoor Amenities:</strong><br><br><ul> <li><strong>Private Pool & Oversized Hot Tub:</strong> Relax in style in the beautifully landscaped backyard just 200 steps from the beach.</li> <li><strong>Summer Kitchen:</strong> Full outdoor kitchen with gas grill, prep space, and pool bath—perfect for al fresco meals.</li> <li><strong>Golf Cart Included:</strong> Cruise 30A in comfort with our brand new 6-seater street-legal golf cart, included FREE with your stay!</li> <li><strong>Beach Setup:</strong> We provide complimentary daily beach service with 4 chairs and 2 umbrellas. More available online.</li> </ul><br><strong>Entertainment & Technology:</strong><br><br><ul> <li>Smart TVs in every bedroom + multiple common areas</li> <li>Fast Wi-Fi with extenders throughout the property</li> <li>High-end sound system controllable on each floor and outdoors</li> </ul><br><strong>Extras & Concierge Services:</strong><br><br><ul> <li>Luxury car rentals and private drivers available upon request</li> <li>Private chef referrals available for in-home dining experiences</li> <li>Optional grocery stocking and mid-stay cleaning available</li> </ul><br><strong>Location:</strong><br><br><ul> <li>200 steps to public beach access</li> <li>20 minutes from Destin Executive Airport (DTS)</li> <li>40 minutes from Destin-Fort Walton (VPS) & 45 minutes from Panama City (ECP)</li> <li>Minutes to restaurants, coffee shops, golf courses, and boutique shopping</li> </ul><br>This home has everything you need to settle in and unwind without ever leaving the property. Please note, the home is not suitable for parties or events—only serene, high-end vacations.<br><br><strong>Newly Built Gulf Front Home in Santa Rosa Beach – Sleeps 38 | Luxury + Location</strong>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
